  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Private Sector Development Programme in Malawi</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme aims to build capacity to support key public sector institutions that shape the regulatory environment for business, help the oil seed sector reach its full potential through the establishment of sustainable market structures supported by government, and provide financial and technical support to business adopting pro-poor business models.</narrative>
  </description>
